{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"My dearest Marie,\n\nThe Parisian theatre is a curious mix of brilliance and tedium. I passed Pesaroni tonight; his reputation was too loud, and I would not waste an evening on mere noise. Instead, we attended the English company at the Odeon. The language was strange in my ears, but the actors possessed a certain raw, unpolished energy that the Italians lack. I have already seen Mlle Mars in *Emilia*. She is a force of nature, though perhaps too intense for my taste.\n\nI find myself thinking of you and the boys. Berlin feels distant, yet the longing for home is a constant companion in these foreign streets. I am tired, but the journey continues. I hope the weather has been kind to the garden.\n\nYour loving\nGeorg"}}],"created":1795219140,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":165,"prompt_tokens":921,"total_tokens":1086,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-Q7jeFpoxZWTjcXyGLc5K4c6drgmztnal","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":921,"prompt_ms":1019.747,"prompt_per_token_ms":1.107217155266015,"prompt_per_second":903.165196857652,"predicted_n":165,"predicted_ms":3893.878,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.743158536585366,"predicted_per_second":42.117395562983745}}